    "Id": "mechdef_devastator_DVS-11",
    "Name": "Devastator DVS-11",
    "Details": "After the DVS-10 was met quite unfavourably by the AFFS, Corean fell under severe pressure to bring back the original Devastator and its powerful punch. However, they instead reworked the assault 'Mech once more. The resulting DVS-11 is the compromise no one knew they needed. Nearly as fast as the -10, the return of the classic weaponry—dual Gauss rifles and a PPC—allows this Devastator to tangle with the toughest of Atlases or Stalkers. It is regarded as a premier line-breaker, and its swift sales have prompted Norse-Storm executives to approach Corean for a licensing agreement.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "DevastatorM"
  },
